# Aero DS — SaaS product + Storybook

**Scope:** Glob-scoped (see YAML `globs`) — attaches when you work under `src/app`, `src/stories`, Storybook preview, theme/token CSS, `src/config`, or root `src/*.{ts,tsx}`. Not `alwaysApply`; open a matching file so guidance is included without `@` tags.

This workspace is **one SaaS product** (ShareConsolidated / Bird AI shell): dashboards, agents, tasks, settings, workflows, in-app data views. Do not default to marketing landing pages, portfolio layouts, or generic "website" patterns unless explicitly requested.

