## Main canvas + bordered widgets

When combining **`MainCanvasViewHeader`** with bordered cards (charts, KPI bands, tables):

1. **Horizontal band** — same `px-*` on header and scroll body (e.g. `px-8`). Override header default with `className="!px-8"` when needed (see [`Dashboard.v1.tsx`](src/app/components/Dashboard.v1.tsx)).
2. **No `border-b`** on the header band — the title row stays open into the body; use inner cards/toolbars for dividers.
3. **Titles** — page title: `MAIN_VIEW_PRIMARY_HEADING_CLASS`; card titles: same class on `<h3>`; card sublines: `MAIN_VIEW_SUBHEADING_CLASS`.
4. **Card interior** — bordered shell + `px-6` so content doesn't sit on the border.
5. **Flex column** — `flex flex-col items-stretch` (not `items-center`) so header rows span full width.

Same primary heading tokens apply to Dialog / Sheet / Drawer / AlertDialog titles.

**Storybook:** Design System/Tokens → **Main canvas + bordered widgets**.

